   317	
   318	- **One class at a time** (Alex, 2026-10-29: "你一类一类改，快速迭代然后测regression"). Count the misses by mechanism; take the largest
   319	  class; trace it to the sentence that causes it; change one thing aimed at that class; run the whole bench (a prompt change alters every
   320	  request) against the previous version; read every regression to its raw answer. The pages that showed the failure locate its
   321	  mechanism; only the whole bench (every set, every draw) accepts the change.
   322	- **Name the effect on the judgement first.** Every proposed change states the effect it is expected to have on a reader or on the final
   323	  judgement, and is tested there where possible; a step's own counts do not decide it alone. A fix that keeps moving its error to
   324	  neighbouring cases stops being tuned on that set (Alex, 2026-11-09: "感觉现在一直在修一些mknor的原地打转，你是不是要思考下现在具体还差什么high priority big impact 的需要做？";
