   327	  three samples beside a fresh control; a bar the control fails against itself judges nothing. A direct-read pass
   328	  (one send per article, every answer read beside its source; D238) locates mechanisms; its counts are one draw and are labelled so.
   329	- **A written log.** One row per arm: hypothesis, change, numbers against the control (regressions first), kept or not. Refuted arms and
   330	  your own mistakes stay in it; the next session starts from its last row.
   331	- **Own the loop, within what Alex agreed.** When the direction is agreed and no stop is in force (`CURRENT_STATE.md`), push your own
   332	  hypotheses through $0 checks and probes of a few cents on stored cases without asking. A registered test, an end-to-end run, or
   333	  anything that departs from the agreed plan starts on his word; a result that contradicts the hypothesis stops the line and goes to him
